2) On node C

2.1) Upon receiving REQ_POST_ALLOC_KP_BLOCK in KeyRouterFrontendHandler.java, it reads a block of key from QLL layer, generates a UUID for the block
2.2) In ServerHandler.java, it writes the key to keypool file with block uuid as filename

